Package: crewtop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Mark Friedgan <hubrix@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.28), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/hubrix/crewtop
Description: htop for agents running and tokens burned across the crew
 A terminal dashboard of coding-agent activity and usage. The package carries
 its own Node 24 runtime and the pinned ccusage, so it needs no system Node.
